OL,4,G0350FWitness History
OL,5,     GOn 26 January 1926, John Logie
OL,6,     GBaird demonstrated his
OL,7,     G'televisor' in public. It was the
OL,8,     Gprototype for television. His
OL,9,     Ggrandson, Iain Logie Baird, spoke
OL,10,     Gabout it in 2010.
